{"text": "The gentleman led Jemima to a lonely, gloomy little house among the foxgloves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was made of sticks and turf, and two broken buckets made a chimney. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This is my summer house, he said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is more comfortable than my winter house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind the house there was an old shed made of soap boxes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The shed was almost full of feathers, and it was hard to breathe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima was a little surprised to see so many feathers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But it was soft and comfortable, and she made a nest easily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The gentleman promised to take great care of her nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every afternoon Jemima came back, and she laid nine eggs in the nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The gentleman liked them very much, and he often counted them when Jemima was away.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "g", "e", "n", "t", "l", "e", "m", "a", "n", " ", "l", "e", "d", " ", "J", "e", "m", "i", "m", "a", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "n", "e", "l", "y", ",", " ", "g", "l", "o", "o", "m", "y", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", " ", "a", "m", "o", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "x", "g", "l", "o", "v", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "m", "a", "d", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "s", "t", "i", "c", "k", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "u", "r", "f", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "b", "r", "o", "k", "e", "n", " ", "b", "u", "c", "k", "e", "t", "s", " ", "m", "a", "d", "e", " ", "a", " ", "c", "h", "i", "m", "n", "e", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "i", "s", " ", "i", "s", " ", "m", "y", " ", "s", "u", "